==Description==
The '''Classic Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from beating all five maps on [[The Classic Event]] while it was active.

The '''Classic Nametag''' has a white vertical gradient text with a red outline. {{Tix|}} and {{Token|}} can be seen being thrown around behind the text.

Underneath the text is a green bar that will randomly get filled with a random amount of red. Whenever the bar is fully filled with red, the classic OOF sound effect will play.

